  <History Date="02-03-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="17-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSV mode and linked to vdim for compatibility." />
  <History Date="27-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="28-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised 5, 7 and 9 DMX mappings lin line with latest documentation (note 8 DMX and HSV modes are not listed)" />
  <History Date="28-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing sine and burst shutter ranges.  Added missing scroll and random colour macro functions." />
  <History Date="11-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added alternative 5 channel mode and Atlabase ID in response to customer request (different channel mapping to current documentation)" />
  <History Date="12-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed vdim in alternative 5 channel mode." />
